{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1793634043,"nonce":"CM50hTV1ytDTcEbR0vFxZYRquy0=","message":"Scope widened (owner, 2026-11-02): port the reference chart rather than only moving the palette. cn::chart is static div+SVG drawings (line, bar, sparkline, threshold, histogram, comparison) with no reactivity, hover, tooltip, legend, animation, area/stacked/grouped bars or pie. The reference is one canvas plot with positioned text labels, a hover cursor and tooltip, a legend, series as value/Signal/Computed animating old-\u003enew, and colours from CSS.\n\nDecided: draw with blinc_layout's canvas widget and Div pointer handlers. Not blinc_canvas_kit: it depends on Blinc by git rev (two copies of blinc_layout/blinc_core downstream), cannot be a crates.io dependency of a published crate, and pulls blinc_gpu/wgpu/the 3D stack; its pan/zoom/spatial-hash interaction is for infinite canvases, while a chart's hover is the category under the pointer x.\n\nSteps, each its own commit with headless tests, demo and book:\n1. Engine: Stylesheet resolves a variable to a colour through var() chains (public), so a canvas reads its palette from the active stylesheet. CN_STYLES: --chart-1..5, --cn-chart-grid, --cn-chart-cursor, --cn-chart-surface, --chart-baseline.\n2. Plot core (chart/ module split under 1k LOC each): geometry, nice ticks, compact numbers, smooth/linear/step curves; line and area (stacked) charts with value axis, category labels, dashed grid, legend, hover cursor and tooltip; series and labels as value/Signal/Computed; value changes ease old-\u003enew.\n3. Bars: grouped, stacked, horizontal, rounded outer ends, hover band.\n4. Pie and donut with total and caption, hover.\n5. Sparkline, threshold (bands, baseline, dots by band), histogram (bins, log scale, markers) and comparison (paired bars, change notes) on the plot; old builders removed; cn_demo gallery; book rewritten (its chart section documents an API that never existed).","files":null}]}